      "content": "Fig. 3, 'Impact of inconsistent product information'. An arrow labelled PHYSICAL FLOW OF HEALTH PRODUCTS runs across five actors: manufacturers, central warehouse, health facilities, community health workers and patients. Beneath them sit the systems each stage uses — a warehouse management system, an eLMIS and paper forms — and each holds the same product under a different code (123123, A1232, P44545, AM545). Broken-chain icons join the codes, showing that the identifiers do not link up along the chain.",
