      "content": "policies to promote \nproduct master data \nstandardization\nManufacturers and distributors of health products are the \nsource of truth for product master data. Ensuring that \nmanufacturers and distributors consistently provide \nproduct master data in a standardized and uniform format \nis crucial for enabling interoperability and leveraging \nautomation through barcode scanning.\nRegulatory organizations play a key role in establishing \npolicies and legislation that mandate and enforce \nrequirements for manufacturers and distributors to supply \nstandardized product master data. This chapter outline",
